衞，若伐曹、衞，楚必救之，則宋免矣。」於是晉作三軍。趙衰舉郤縠將中軍，郤臻佐之；使狐偃將上軍，狐毛佐之，命趙衰爲卿；欒枝將下軍，先軫佐之；荀林父御戎，魏犫爲右：往伐。冬十二月，晉兵先下山東，而以原封趙衰。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p066","text":"四年，楚成王及諸侯圍宋，宋公孫固如晉告急。先軫曰：「報施定霸，於今在矣。」狐偃曰：「楚新得曹而初婚於衞，若伐曹、衞，楚必救之，則宋免矣。」於是晉作三軍。趙衰舉郤縠將中軍，郤臻佐之；使狐偃將上軍，狐毛佐之，命趙衰爲卿；欒枝將下軍，先軫佐之；荀林父御戎，魏犫爲右：往伐。冬十二月，晉兵先下山東，而以原封趙衰。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"楚成王","kind":"person","person_id":"2d3_fsd_1dh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"宋公孫固","kind":"person","person_id":"rrj_dpd_03c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"先軫","kind":"person","person_id":"zql_k3t_8ro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"xxq_5y6_8sr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"三軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"趙衰","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"郤縠","kind":"person","person_id":"8u9_s13_86r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"郤臻","kind":"person","person_id":"azb_h5v_rtu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"狐偃","kind":"person","person_id":"xxq_5y6_8sr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m066-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"狐毛","kind":"person","person_id":"6hd_nol_p5r","status":"contextual_p